## Deliberately not run

No live invocation of triggerOperatorExecution()/runExecutionSession()
against the real repo — the kill switch (OPERATOR_EXECUTION_ONRAMP_ENABLED)
is not set anywhere, so the capability is inert by construction; exercising
it for real would mean actually opening a PR against this org, which is
exactly the blast radius this VTID's default-OFF gate exists to prevent
until the platform owner deliberately turns it on and observes it.
